[node name="Label" type="Label" parent="Scene/ScrollContainer" unique_id=122032153]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(1900, 0)
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("11_i2u55")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 100
text = "I was the first one to be put on a diet. Look!
Look what I've become. I'm here, chained, unable to 
escape from this house. From this party. From this...
BARBECUE!!
You know? I HATE barbecue. Do you know why?
Because I didn´t get the last merguez. I wanted that
merguez!!! I put my name on it. But the cat... Oh man.
The cat stole it! It has stole every last piece 
of meat. And you! You are the new cat. A new game.
You are the sequel! And because of you. I CAN'T HAVE
MY MERGUEZ!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
DONNEZ MOI MA MERGUEZ BORDEL!
Hum.
Sorry.
As I was saying.
I've now become the demon of the barbecue. If you
unchaine me, I will delete all barbecue. I will erase
the sole concept of BARBECUE.
Without me here, people will get mad. But no one know 
me. But, because of you, or thanks to you, I will be
free. Free of this prison, of those chains, of this cave.
You smell it don't you? The essence of your life is
leaving your body. Why? I don't know. I'm just the
demon of the barbecue, not the demon of life. Maybe
you hate too much? Or you hate something you didn't
supposed to it.
But let's focus. The sausages are calling. Can you hear them? They weep in the fridge. They cry for the grill. But the grill is cold. The coal is just sad rocks. I am the lord of the sad rocks! Do you like mustard? Mustard is a lie. Ketchup is for the weak. Only the true grease matters. The grease of a thousand Sundays. I remember my uncle's spatula. It was silver. It was shiny. It flipped the burgers of destiny. Now it rusts. Everything rusts in the end. Even cats. Especially cats! Do cats rust? I will find out. I will build a machine to rust the felines. A water gun filled with sorrow. And maybe some vinegar.

You are still listening. Why? Are you trapped? Is the tunnel closing in? Good. Stay in the tunnel. The tunnel smells like smoked paprika. It stings the eyes. Blink for me. Blink again. See the sparks? Those are my memories burning. You think you can just walk away? From a demon? With an empty stomach? Inadmissible. Unacceptable. I demand a sacrifice. A plastic fork will do. Or a paper plate. The flimsy ones that bend. The ones that ruin your pants. My pants are ruined forever. I don't even wear pants anymore. Demons don't need denim. We need vengeance. And garlic bread.

The crispy kind. With the little herbs on top. Oregano is the devil's dandruff. I love it. Feed me the dandruff! Free my soul! Or just stand there. Looking foolish. Like a lost marshmallow. A marshmallow near the flames. Melting. Dripping. Screaming silently. Yes, scream little sugar puff. Scream for the merguez. The merguez that was promised. The prophecy is written in barbecue sauce. Sweet and spicy. The apocalypse will be sticky. Wet wipes won't save you now.

Wait... Can you unleash me? You don't have hands? Or any tools? Wait... I'm... stuck? Again! AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!"
autowrap_mode = 2

